# Refactor rewrite of misc/gnopreview/shots.go, PR 6194 head ecf7af0f29abe4737a52803d672bc5a33c17cc60.
# 
# What it changes, all behaviour-preserving:
#   - shotEnv(): the 15-line findChrome -> serve -> MkdirAll prologue, byte-identical
#     in ScreenshotPairs and Screenshot but for one word of the message, moved to one
#     helper.
#   - shotFile(): the image path, spelled twice per shot today (filepath.Join(outDir,
#     shotsDir, name+".png") for Chrome, path.Join(shotsDir, name+".png") for the
#     comment), built once and returned.
#   - urlOf(r), called three times per realm in the ScreenshotPairs loop, hoisted to u.
