#     FileOf (crawl.go:338) is exactly that lookup, and the sibling function already
#     uses it.
#   - findChrome builds its candidate list as one literal.
#   - Screenshot's serve() origin renamed base -> origin; "base" is the merge-base
#     *Crawler forty lines up.
# 
# Measured, not claimed: this is NOT shorter. 213 -> 223 file lines, 169 -> 170
# non-comment lines. The win is one prologue instead of two and one spelling of the
# image path, not fewer lines.
